MODULE 1: WHAT IS ARTIFICIAL INTELLIGENCE?
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

INTRODUCTION: 

- In this module, you will learn what Artificial Intelligence(AI) is, what it does, and the three
    levels of predictions that AI can make.
    1. Narrow
    2. Broad
    3. General


LEARNING OBJECTIVES:

- After completing this module, you should be able to
    -> Define Artificial Intelligence(AI)
    -> Differentiate between AI and Augmented Intelligence
    -> Describe three levels of Artificial Intelligence
    

